%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogues_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dbcfa153334420642a74bbaaf4718f82, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 11973013504
    m_Localized: "Ow! Ow, ow! Please don't squish me! I'm\u2026 I'm friendly. I think.
      Well, that's what I say. I'm not exactly the most reliable source on that.
      Sorry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 277950607360
    m_Localized: Where am I?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11487085314027520
    m_Localized: Okay, it's simple. You move the paddle. The ball bounces. The blocks
      break. If the ball falls, we lose a life. Please don't let that happen. I get
      very nervous when it happens. Sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11500370767753216
    m_Localized: "That's\u2026 a very good question. Really good. I don't have an
      answer. Sorry. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11856825014398976
    m_Localized: How do we get out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11857092103483392
    m_Localized: 'That one I think I know! Well. Sort of. I''ve seen the floating
      blocks break when something hits them hard enough. If we break them all, I
      think we''ll find the exit. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11856143909761024
    m_Localized: What I do know is that we've been trapped here for a while. I say
      "we" because now you're trapped too. Sorry about that as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11863475901280256
    m_Localized: I have a paddle, a ball, and a bit of magic. Not much. Well, very
      little. Will you help me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12276868411928576
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve got some magic too. I can make your paddle longer so
      it\u2019s easier to catch the ball. Just collect my power-ups that pop out
      of the blocks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12277683998535680
    m_Localized: "Oh. Well. It's fine. Really. I need to tell you something about
      my magic. Sometimes\u2026 sometimes it goes a little backwards. The paddle-extending
      thing\u2026 it may have shrunk it a few times."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11502131540766720
    m_Localized: We need to go faster! If the ball goes faster, we break the blocks
      sooner and we escape sooner! It's just maths!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12279841561096192
    m_Localized: It's not maths. It's impatience dressed up as strategy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12280010859982848
    m_Localized: And you want to go slow! How do you escape by going slow?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12280728731889664
    m_Localized: With precision. Which is something you're not familiar with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12281128746856448
    m_Localized: Hello! Sorry to interrupt. We're also trying to escape. I think
      we could help each other. If you want. If not, that's fine too. Sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12281386981765120
    m_Localized: 'Escape? I can speed up the ball! Full speed! We break everything
      in no time! Can we start now? By de way, I''m Lumo '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12281951195344896
    m_Localized: And I can slow it down. To aim. To think. To not crash everything
      at random. My name is Umbra.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12282401848143872
    m_Localized: Who wants to aim when you can go at maximum speed?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12283187445477376
    m_Localized: Anyone with a minimum of common sense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12283362477977600
    m_Localized: Great! New friends! I think.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12279753954668544
    m_Localized: We should look for more help. I think I'm not enough on my own.
      Though I'm not giving up, okay? Not at all. Well. A little. But not entirely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12583136120909824
    m_Localized: Someone arrives carrying a foldable shop that she sets up in three
      seconds with a suspicious efficiency.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12583438089826304
    m_Localized: Customers! Finally, customers in this forgotten hole! I am Ribbitra.
      Welcome to Ribbitra's Emporium. Upgrades, balls, and everything a trapped adventurer
      needs. What can I get you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12584011467960320
    m_Localized: A SHOP? In here? HOW?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12584256465645568
    m_Localized: Where there are trapped people, there's business. Universal law.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12584647576104960
    m_Localized: That's mildly unsettling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12585373354274816
    m_Localized: What kind of upgrades do you have? Sorry if that's a bad question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12585569563815936
    m_Localized: 'The best upgrades. Things that''ll help you advance, break more
      blocks, hold on longer. Everything you need to escape. And the best part: in
      exchange for souls.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12585811810037760
    m_Localized: Souls? Where do we get souls from?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12586010670379008
    m_Localized: "They\u2019re left behind when the blocks break. You\u2019ll have
      seen them \u2013 energy being released, round and blue. Don\u2019t ask for
      any more details; it makes the explanation too complicated for me. The important
      thing is that they\u2019re valid, and I accept them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12587174308720640
    m_Localized: "As they look round the shop, you spot an old book in a corner with
      a cover that glimmers slightly. It\u2019s exorbitantly priced."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12587499275005952
    m_Localized: What's that book? What is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12588431517790208
    m_Localized: Ah, that. The Mystic Book. One of a kind. Unrepeatable. Exclusive.
      A relic. The price is what it is because it's worth what it's worth. Not on
      sale. There will be no sale. Ever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12588932300910592
    m_Localized: "That's\u2026 a lot of souls."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12589137511428096
    m_Localized: Yes. Because it's one of a kind. Have I mentioned it's one of a
      kind?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12589735254274048
    m_Localized: About three times.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12589934655680512
    m_Localized: What does it actually do? Sorry if that's a bit nosy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12590099869315072
    m_Localized: "They say it grants power to whoever uses it. And it\u2019s one
      of a kind. A relic. I\u2019ve already said that, haven\u2019t I?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12592819120484352
    m_Localized: "Hey. Hey, hey. We\u2019ve got to try and make some progress, haven\u2019t
      we? I reckon if we just stand here\u2026 we won\u2019t get anywhere. Sorry
      if that\u2019s a bit obvious. Try to get to at least stage 2."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15105086667993088
    m_Localized: I think we're making progress. A little. Well, some. Some is something,
      right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15105254184300544
    m_Localized: Getting closer every second! I can feel it! In my wings I can feel
      it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15105428432465920
    m_Localized: What I feel is that there's still a long way to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15105582145318912
    m_Localized: A soft sob interrupts the conversation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15105785585840128
    m_Localized: "Was\u2026 was that Nimbo?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15105948207394816
    m_Localized: No, it wasn't me. Sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15106039441895424
    m_Localized: Ribbitra?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15106135004917760
    m_Localized: I don't cry. Bad for business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15106251254247424
    m_Localized: Another sob. The group looks around. And then they see it. Right
      beside them. It had been there for a while and nobody had noticed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15108019132411904
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15108146291126272
    m_Localized: AAAH! It has eyes! TWO EYES! WHERE THEY SHOULDN'T BE!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15108268177600512
    m_Localized: How long have you been standing there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15108511333986304
    m_Localized: "\u2026They're where they are. Not where you expected them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15108838183514112
    m_Localized: A while. Nobody saw me. I'm used to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15110364641734656
    m_Localized: "Hi. I'm Nimbo. Sorry we got scared. That was\u2026 not very kind
      of us. Are you okay?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15110477556592640
    m_Localized: Not really. I'm Cardia. People always get scared. And I only give
      life. That's all I do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15110659417419776
    m_Localized: "Extra life sounds\u2026 really good for us. I think we could really
      use that. If you wanted to help. Sorry if that's a lot to ask."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15110986606686208
    m_Localized: You're asking me to stay? Nobody's going to run away?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15112062898647040
    m_Localized: "Of course not! A new customer is always welcome. Come, come, I
      have things you might be interested in\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16923577880522752
    m_Localized: Ah! Who are you? Are you dangerous?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16923733132685312
    m_Localized: "We're not dangerous. I think. Well, I'm not. The others\u2026 probably
      not either. I think. Sorry."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16923920383193088
    m_Localized: "It's just\u2026 I don't know how I got here. I was learning to
      walk. It was my first day. And then I fell and\u2026 I was here. Do you know
      how to get out?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16924031028932608
    m_Localized: Same as us! We're trying to escape!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16924214940774400
    m_Localized: Can I come with you? I don't want to be alone. You can call me Draco.
      I want to find my mother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16924595158626304
    m_Localized: Of course. Of course you can. Sorry it took us a moment to say so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16924787425521664
    m_Localized: "I have scales. They're very hard. I can put them under the paddle
      so the ball doesn't fall through. I don't know if it helps much, but\u2026
      it's the only thing I know how to do right now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16924959144521728
    m_Localized: It helps. A lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
